  "data_source": "real: compilation `real` part (internal research corpus of real fingerprint images), development folds 0-4, without LivDet, without the identities in the first corpus's relabel map and without any image identical to an image of those identities (exact content key); 126 first-corpus images could not be assigned to an identity; no synthetic data",
  "duplicate_basenames": 1487,
  "encoders": {
    "deepprint": {
      "batch_size": 32,
      "dim": 512,
      "preprocessing": "compilation images: cv2.imread(path, IMREAD_GRAYSCALE), the full image (no footer crop, as flx's loaders for real data), to_tensor; flx LazilyAllocatedBinarizer(5.0); one zero column (taller) or row (wider) appended only when the height-width difference is odd, because flx asserts a square after symmetric padding; flx pad_and_resize_to_deepprint_input_size (zero padding to a square, antialiased resize to 299 x 299); DeepPrint_TexMinu(num_training_subjects=8000, num_dims=256), released best_model.pyt, eval; feature = concat(texture 256, minutia 256) via flx extract_embeddings and EmbeddingLoader.combine",
      "preprocessing_parity": "parity images of the old corpus: the reference loader flx SFingeLoader._load_image (cv2.imread(path, IMREAD_GRAYSCALE), bottom 32 rows cropped: the SFinGe footer, to_tensor), then the same chain as for compilation images",
      "weights_sha256": {
        "fixed-length-fingerprint-extractors/best_model.pyt": "2683a04427bacd54adc00cfdc97474625b1e11e5a9e6672c5129f033018f8a28"
      }
    },
    "fingervit": {
      "batch_size": 1,
      "dim": 1536,
      "preprocessing": "PIL Image.open(path).convert('RGB'); torchvision Resize((224, 224)), ToTensor, Normalize(mean=[0.761, 0.760, 0.760], std=[0.287, 0.287, 0.288]); AutoModel.from_pretrained(finger-vit_giant), eval, no_grad; feature = last_hidden_state[:, 0] (CLS)",
      "weights_sha256": {
        "finger-vit_giant/config.json": "5eeefae61674737a7c1b7a20486d63a39f5b4f2c27cadc3f975596cda18e9930",
        "finger-vit_giant/model.safetensors": "d386f7acae9289c075ccf3560976a3e2519da13d82cecb6aa72a0d490d208fc2"
      }
    },
    "stored": "each row L2-normalised, float32; row i belongs to manifest row i"
  },
